              </?01M05F1PTBQS2R025B07RP956C>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T2.2" name = "实现稳定 history mapper 与 context projection" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PTBQS2R025B07RP956D>
            用 message/tool/resource identity 增量 reconcile，tool role 重建 ToolPart，system/internal 隐藏，context metadata 进入折叠卡片
